		(descr "Newhaven NHD-2.7-12864WDW3-M 2.7 in 128x64 OLED module, 82 x 47.5, on standoffs in front of the board, glass toward the panel. Board-only: no pads; the module's d2.5 holes (2.5 in from each edge) are drilled in the board outline. Origin at the module's top-left corner seen from the front. The 3D model is Newhaven's CTP (touch) variant - the same module outline and holes, plus a touch panel and its flex tail.")
